OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over plan for firelighter
OL,4,Awarehouse near homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a warehouse intended to
OL,7,Fhold up to 600 tonnes of firelighters
OL,8,Fnear a residential area have been
OL,9,Frecommended for approval by council
OL,10,Fplanning officers.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, Flintshire council will
OL,13,Fbe asked to grant permission for
OL,14,Ffirelighter manufacturer Tiger Tim to
OL,15,Fbuild a warehouse for the storage of
OL,16,F992 pallets of firelighters just 30m
OL,17,Ffrom homes on Wern Road, Rhosesmor,
OL,18,Fnear Mold.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
