OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over plan for firelighter
OL,4,Awarehouse near homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal was previously deferred
OL,7,Fbecause of concerns over scale and
OL,8,Fsafety, and the potential impact on
OL,9,Flocal residents.
OL,11,FTiger Tim's planning agents, Caulmert
OL,12,FEngineering and Environmental Planning,
OL,13,Fsaid measures had been taken to
OL,14,Fmitigate local people's fears.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
